---
export const prerender = true;
import credits from '../../public/credits.json';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" /><title>Media sources — Haven Art</title></head>
<body style="font-family:system-ui;max-width:60rem;margin:3rem auto;padding:1rem;line-height:1.6">
<a href="/">Back to Haven Art</a><h1>Media sources and licenses</h1>
<p>The shipped music is original procedural synthesis by Haven Soundscapes, generated by scripts/generate-original-audio.mjs. It uses generated waveforms and independently composed note sequences, without samples from commercial recordings. These recordings are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0.</p>
<p>Live photographs show a source and license link in the experience. Unknown Wikimedia licenses are excluded.</p>
<ul>{credits.assets.map(asset => <li><strong>{asset.title}</strong> — {asset.author}. <a href={asset.source_url}>Source</a> · <a href={asset.license_url}>{asset.license}</a></li>)}</ul>
</body></html>
